Z||000002||theogre||01-25-2001||07:58 PM||||have the charging system tested.<P>check every single wire you can find bolted to the body or the block. one or more of them is likely screwed up. could also be the thin + lead off the battery. (If it's an 84 one of the fuse links on the starter could also be bad)<p>[This message has been edited by theogre (edited 01-25-2001).]||||reg||1
