Z||000012||Homicidal||01-27-2001||08:36 PM||||Do you know where the starter is?<P>It's a cylindrical object right next to the exahust manifold.  It can be seen from the top, but accessed through the bottom.<P>I forget what size it was, you'll just have to experiment there.  <P>The connection that should be the culprit is thick, black, stiff and on the end if memory serves right.<P>But just tighten all of them to be sure!!||||reg||1
